    {"type":"text","id":"sig_note","x":80,"y":620,"width":1300,"height":40,"text":"All three on-chain. iNFT and Campaign are owned by the owner's wallet — the backend never has key access.\nsig 1+3 land on BouncerRegistry (0x7648…7030) and CampaignFactory (0xfe6b…39d4). sig 2 delegates write access for Campaign.recordDecision to the backend executor.","originalText":"All three on-chain. iNFT and Campaign are owned by the owner's wallet — the backend never has key access.\nsig 1+3 land on BouncerRegistry (0x7648…7030) and CampaignFactory (0xfe6b…39d4). sig 2 delegates write access for Campaign.recordDecision to the backend executor.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":200140,"version":1,"versionNonce":200141,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

