    {"type":"text","id":"export_note","x":80,"y":1980,"width":1400,"height":36,"text":"WhitelistMint contracts verify the Merkle proof against the root, then mint to the proven address. Approved → mint succeeds. Rejected → NotApproved revert.\nRoot is committed by Campaign.finalizeMerkleRoot on 0G first (owner-signed, one-shot), then exported off chain for the destination network.","originalText":"WhitelistMint contracts verify the Merkle proof against the root, then mint to the proven address. Approved → mint succeeds. Rejected → NotApproved revert.\nRoot is committed by Campaign.finalizeMerkleRoot on 0G first (owner-signed, one-shot), then exported off chain for the destination network.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":400080,"version":1,"versionNonce":400081,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
